		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  audit table with integer column]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=23672#p23672"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>According to the doc, concat ignores NULL arguments. Try manual concatenation with quote_nullable() the args instead.</p>]]></content>
