	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  audit table with integer column]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=23671#p23671"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>I already tried this syntax but postgres doesn&#039;t like:<br />mydb=# INSERT INTO proposition VALUES(2944,&#039;Example&#039;,NULL);<br />ERROR:&#160; invalid input syntax for integer: &quot;NULL&quot;<br />LINE 1: ...),&#039;,&#039;,CASE WHEN NEW.&quot;categorySignId&quot; IS NULL THEN &#039;NULL&#039; ELS...<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;^<br />QUERY:&#160; INSERT INTO audit (stamp,query) VALUES( now(), CONCAT(&#039;INSERT INTO proposition VALUES(&#039;,NEW.id,&#039;,&#039;,quote_nullable(NEW.text),&#039;,&#039;,CASE WHEN NEW.&quot;categorySignId&quot; IS NULL THEN &#039;NULL&#039; ELSE NEW.&quot;categorySignId&quot; END,&#039;);&#039;))<br />CONTEXT:&#160; PL/pgSQL function process_audit() line 269 at SQL statement</p><p>This comes from the apostrophes around &#039;NULL&#039;</p>]]></content>
