		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Are you aware that this is a french speaking board? Also, next time please post your topic in a more suited category. For now I move it to the general technical section.</p><br /><p>Something like that should work:</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>[...] CASE WHEN NEW.&quot;categorySignId&quot; IS NULL THEN &#039;NULL&#039; ELSE NEW.&quot;categorySignId&quot; END [...]</code></pre></div>]]></content>
