	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[audit table with integer column]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=23655#p23655"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Hell,</p><p>I have a table proposition<br />&#160; &#160; &#160;Column&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; Type&#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; Modifiers<br />------------------+---------+-----------------------------------------------------<br /> id&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; | integer&#160; | not null default nextval(&#039;proposition_id_seq&#039;::regcl<br /> text&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;| text&#160; &#160; &#160; |<br /> categorySignId | integer&#160; |</p><p>I&#039;m auditing in table audit all modifications made on table proposition via an audit function containing:<br />&#160; &#160;&#160; &#160;ELSIF (TG_TABLE_NAME = &#039;proposition&#039;) THEN<br />&#160; &#160;&#160; &#160; &#160;IF (TG_OP = &#039;DELETE&#039;) THEN<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; INSERT INTO audit (stamp,query) VALUES( now(), CONCAT(&#039;DELETE FROM proposition WHERE id=&#039;,OLD.id,&#039;;&#039;));<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; RETURN OLD;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; ELSIF (TG_OP = &#039;UPDATE&#039;) THEN<br />&#160; &#160;&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;INSERT INTO audit (stamp,query) VALUES( now(), CONCAT(&#039;UPDATE proposition SET text=&#039;,quote_nullable(NEW.text),&#039;,&quot;categorySignId&quot;=&#039;,NEW.&quot;categorySignId&quot;,&#039; WHERE id=&#039;,NEW.id,&#039;;&#039;));<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; RETURN NEW;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; ELSIF (TG_OP = &#039;INSERT&#039;) THEN<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; INSERT INTO audit (stamp,query) VALUES( now(), CONCAT(&#039;INSERT INTO proposition VALUES(&#039;,NEW.id,&#039;,&#039;,quote_nullable(NEW.text),&#039;,&#039;,NEW.&quot;categorySignId&quot;,&#039;);&#039;));<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; RETURN NEW;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; END IF;</p><p>When i insert following record in proposition:<br />INSERT INTO proposition VALUES(1,&#039;Exemple&#039;,NULL);</p><p>I obtain following an audit record with following query field:<br />INSERT INTO proposition VALUES(1,&#039;Exemple&#039;,);</p><p>This query is not correct, is there a way to obtain NULL string when the integer column is NULL in order to rebuild initial query?</p>]]></content>
